{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月07日に発売の\nAne Can さんの取材を受けたので\n発売されたら\n是非見て下さい☆*:.｡. o(≧▽≦)o .｡.:*☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいと載ります！！\n静岡コンビ、いつもと違った雰囲気でとってます(*^_^*)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えいっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/02/08/6263356/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井中田若月(=ﾟωﾟ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良しこ。まなったんもいればよかったのだけど。いなかったの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井が昨日わかんちに泊りに来てたよ(^｡^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこ予告で噂の桜井が。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にDVD見て、キャッキャッして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝ました(｀_´)ゞ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒のベットでくっついてぎゅーってして寝たの\\(//∇//)\\"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うふふ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていいたいところですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ桜井が私のベットで寝て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は床で毛布にくるまって寝たよね。泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"固いよ。冷たいよ。雪だよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな所も嫌いじゃないけどね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかね、桜井とは家族化しておるから\nすんごいゆる～い時間を過ごしてしまう。\nいつもありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな桜井を駅まで送った後すぐに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『もう会いたい気もする』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってメール来たよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツンデレとはこういうことを言うのか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私も『もう寂しい気もする』と返すあたり駄目だな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"内容ない話でごめんね(´･Д･)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/02/08/6263356/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井を送っていった時はまだ早くて大丈夫だったんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪...凄かったですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん\n大丈夫でしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫じゃないですよね（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ積もった雪があって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"危ないから外出は気をつけてくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も気をつけます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、おやすみなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんと会いたいなんて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思ってないんだからね！←ツンデレ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばいっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/02/08/6263356/0002.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}